          {
            "id": "part-1-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10: Complete the form below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<div><div>Rental Property Application Form</div><table class=\"q-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Name:</td><td>Susan Smith <em>(Example)</em></td></tr><tr><td>Phone number:</td><td>{{1}} (mobile)</td></tr><tr><td>Email address:</td><td>Susansmith@{{2}}</td></tr><tr><td>Current address:</td><td>234 Becketts Road, Brisbane. 4054</td></tr><tr><td>New Zealand Employer:</td><td>Auckland Hospital</td></tr><tr><td>Occupation:</td><td>a {{3}}</td></tr><tr><td>Rental start date:</td><td>8th February</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Preferred property type:</p><p>first preference: a house with a {{4}}</p><p>second preference: an apartment with a big {{5}}</p><table class=\"q-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Bedrooms:</td><td>two</td></tr><tr><td>Furnishings:</td><td>a {{6}} is required</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum rent:</td><td>{{7}} $ per week</td></tr><tr><td>Preferred location:</td><td>near the {{8}}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Other requirements:</p><p>must have {{9}} nearby</p><p>would like {{10}} included in the rent</p></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–20: Complete the notes below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<div><div>The Pre-school Family Centre</div><p>Features of the Pre-school Family Centre</p><ul><li>for children from {{11}} to 5 years old</li><li>run as a {{12}} by parents, who attend with their children</li><li>parents receive special {{13}} from the centre</li><li>children's activities organised in {{14}} age groups</li></ul><p>Facts about the Centre</p><ul><li>sessions from 9.30–12.30 each morning</li><li>one afternoon session to help prepare older children for {{15}} at school</li><li>parents must make several {{16}} before they enroll their child</li><li>each centre is officially recognised and receives {{17}} funding</li></ul><p>Parents' Commitments</p><ul><li>take on responsibility for a special {{18}}</li><li>attend one {{19}}</li></ul><p>Practical Advice</p><ul><li>attend regularly to help your child gain {{20}}</li><li>younger children may need to leave early</li><li>provide a snack for your child</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 4
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 3,
        "title": "Part 3",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 21–30.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-3-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 21–26: Choose the correct letter, A, B or C.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 21,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;John and Cath's presentation plans are different in",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; the examples used."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; the order of information."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; the main points made."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 22,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What do the students agree about the anatomy section of their presentation?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; It would be better if Cath spoke about it."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; It should be kept quite short."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; It should be based on information from the internet."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 23,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What do the students agree to include in the last section?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; visuals of injuries"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; demonstrations of treatment"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; interviews with patients"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 24,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What is said about the different types of heel injury?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; Diagnosis is straightforward."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; They are expensive to treat."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; Some are more serious than others."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 25,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;On the subject of causes of heel injuries, the students agree to",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; focus on a single reason."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; reject certain approaches."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; use a source written by their professor."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 26,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Cath say about stretching as a treatment?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; It is potentially risky."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; It is commonly confused with strengthening."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "&nbsp; It is the least effective part of treatment."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-3-group-2",
